  "body": "Positioned on 644sqm (approx.) of gently sloping section, 9 Tautoru Avenue presents a rare chance to secure one of Orewa's most attractive sites. With its easy contour and generous size, this section offers both practicality and potential, making it an exceptional platform for your future build.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none - just moments to Orewa Beach for morning swims and evening walks, close to Silverdale Mall for shopping and dining, and with quick motorway access for an easy commute. Schools, parks and recreational facilities are all within easy reach, making this a highly versatile address for families or those seeking a smart investment.\r\n\r\nWhether you're envisioning a stylish coastal retreat, a modern family haven, or a bespoke architectural design, this site provides the space and setting to bring your vision to life.\r\n\r\nDon't delay - sections like this are in high demand. Contact us today to explore the potential of 9 Tautoru Avenue.",
